<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX 9.8 PCT SURGE SURPRISES TRADERS.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX 9.8 PCT SURGE SURPRISES TRADERS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The scale of the 9.8 percent surge to 32.4 zlotys by Polish builder Budimex SA on Tuesday surprised traders, who said the firm might still be gaining mileage from a recent &quot;accumulate&quot; rating from Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p>Turnover was a session-high 13.8 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Traders also said Budimex and other Polish construction firms would likely continue to benefit from the current increased demand in the construction industry.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
